<title>NETHERLANDS: Fortis 1996 profit up 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Fortis 1996 profit up 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>UTRECHT, Netherlands 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996.</p>
<p>(millions of ECUs unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>FORTIS GROUP --</p>
<p>    Net profit		     731  vs   631</p>
<p>    Operating profit	   1,194  vs 1,100</p>
<p>NOTE - Fortis is a banking and insurance group jointly owned by Fortis AG of Belgium and Fortis AMEV of the Netherlands. Analysts had forecast a 1996 net profit of 720 to 743 million ECU.  </p>
<p>    Operating profit -- insurance	  740   vs    636</p>
<p>    Operating profit -- banking	    519   vs    533</p>
<p>    General costs				 65   vs     72</p>
<p>    Tax					    341   vs    327</p>
<p>    Group profit				 913   vs    817</p>
<p>    Minority interests			 182   vs    186</p>
<p>    Net profit				   731   vs    631</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
